  "question": {
    "text": "From a point <math><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo></math> tangents are drawn to the curve <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the chord of contact is a normal chord and the locus of <math><mi>P</mi></math> is the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0.9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then equation of chord of contact is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />And equation of normal to hyperbola is <math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi></mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />On comparing&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> , we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<br />Now eliminating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get,<br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></math>"
  }
}